.* licensed under the terms of the MIT license which can be found in the
.* root directory of this project.
.*
.* QTOCIFC: CFGTCP option 1, the IPv4 interfaces. WRKIFC has every
.* option, WRKIFCD only 5=Display (a profile without *IOSYSCFG), as
.* the system shows them; F11 steps through three views. DSPIFC is
.* option 5. A heading's blanks force its second row.
:PNLGRP.
:COPYR.(C) COPYRIGHT QUARTZ SYSTEMS 2026.
:CLASS NAME=OPTCL BASETYPE=ACTION.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=ADRCL BASETYPE='CHAR 15'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=NAMECL BASETYPE='CHAR 10'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=STSCL BASETYPE='CHAR 12'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=ALIASCL BASETYPE='CHAR 25'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=TEXTCL BASETYPE='CHAR 50'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=VALCL BASETYPE='CHAR 26'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=VIEWCL BASETYPE='CHAR 1'.
:ECLASS.
:VAR NAME=OPT CLASS=OPTCL.
:VAR NAME=IFCADR CLASS=ADRCL.
:VAR NAME=IFCMASK CLASS=ADRCL.
:VAR NAME=IFCLIND CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=IFCLTYPE CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=IFCSTS CLASS=STSCL.
:VAR NAME=IFCALIAS CLASS=ALIASCL.
:VAR NAME=IFCTEXT CLASS=TEXTCL.
:VAR NAME=VIEW CLASS=VIEWCL VALUE='1'.
:VAR NAME=DADR CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=DMASK CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=DLIND CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=DALIAS CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=DCCSID CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=DLTYPE CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=DLCLIFC CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=DSTS CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=DTOS CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=DMTU CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=DAUTO CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=DTEXT CLASS=TEXTCL.
:LISTDEF NAME=IFCS VARS='OPT IFCADR IFCMASK IFCLIND IFCLTYPE IFCSTS IFCALIAS IFCTEXT'.
:COND NAME=VIEW1 EXPR='&VIEW. EQ "1"'.
:COND NAME=VIEW2 EXPR='&VIEW. EQ "2"'.
:COND NAME=VIEW3 EXPR='&VIEW. EQ "3"'.
:KEYL NAME=WRKKEYS.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F1 ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F5 ACTION='RETURN 5'.F5=Refresh
:KEYI KEY=F6 ACTION='RETURN 6'.F6=Print list
:KEYI KEY=F11 ACTION='RETURN 11' COND=VIEW1.F11=Display interface status
:KEYI KEY=F11 ACTION='RETURN 11' COND=VIEW2.F11=Display text description
:KEYI KEY=F11 ACTION='RETURN 11' COND=VIEW3.F11=Display line information
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:KEYI KEY=F17 ACTION='RETURN 17'.F17=Top
:KEYI KEY=F18 ACTION='RETURN 18'.F18=Bottom
:KEYI KEY=PAGEUP ACTION=PAGEUP.
:KEYI KEY=PAGEDOWN ACTION=PAGEDOWN.
:EKEYL.
:KEYL NAME=DSPKEYS.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F1 ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:KEYI KEY=PAGEUP ACTION=PAGEUP.
:KEYI KEY=PAGEDOWN ACTION=PAGEDOWN.
:EKEYL.
:PANEL NAME=WRKIFC HELP=HLPIFC KEYL=WRKKEYS ENTER='RETURN 0' TOPSEP=SYSNAM BOTSEP=NONE.Work with TCP/IP Interfaces
:TOPINST.Type options, press Enter.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=IFCS SCROLL=YES VIEWS=3 HEADSEP.(No interfaces)
:LISTACT OPTION=1 ENTER='CMD ?ADDTCPIFC'.1=Add
:LISTACT OPTION=2 ENTER='CMD ?CHGTCPIFC INTNETADR(''&IFCADR.'')'.2=Change
:LISTACT OPTION=4 ENTER='CMD RMVTCPIFC INTNETADR(''&IFCADR.'')'.4=Remove
:LISTACT OPTION=5 ENTER='RETURN 105'.5=Display
:LISTACT OPTION=9 ENTER='CMD STRTCPIFC INTNETADR(''&IFCADR.'')'.9=Start
:LISTACT OPTION=10 ENTER='CMD ENDTCPIFC INTNETADR(''&IFCADR.'')'.10=End
:LISTCOL VAR=OPT USAGE=INPUT.Opt
:LISTCOL VAR=IFCADR USAGE=OUTPUT.Internet Address
:LISTCOL VAR=IFCMASK USAGE=OUTPUT.Subnet          Mask
:LISTCOL VAR=IFCLIND USAGE=OUTPUT.Line Description
:LISTCOL VAR=IFCLTYPE USAGE=OUTPUT.Line           Type
:LISTCOL VAR=IFCSTS USAGE=OUTPUT.Interface Status
:LISTCOL VAR=IFCALIAS USAGE=OUTPUT.Alias                         Name
:LISTCOL VAR=IFCTEXT USAGE=OUTPUT.Text
:LISTVIEW COLS='OPT IFCADR IFCMASK IFCLIND IFCLTYPE'.
:LISTVIEW COLS='OPT IFCADR IFCMASK IFCSTS IFCALIAS'.
:LISTVIEW COLS='OPT IFCADR IFCMASK IFCTEXT'.
:ELIST.
:EPANEL.
:PANEL NAME=WRKIFCD HELP=HLPIFC KEYL=WRKKEYS ENTER='RETURN 0' TOPSEP=SYSNAM BOTSEP=NONE.Work with TCP/IP Interfaces
:TOPINST.Type options, press Enter.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=IFCS SCROLL=YES VIEWS=3 HEADSEP.(No interfaces)
:LISTACT OPTION=5 ENTER='RETURN 105'.5=Display
:LISTCOL VAR=OPT USAGE=INPUT.Opt
:LISTCOL VAR=IFCADR USAGE=OUTPUT.Internet Address
:LISTCOL VAR=IFCMASK USAGE=OUTPUT.Subnet          Mask
:LISTCOL VAR=IFCLIND USAGE=OUTPUT.Line Description
:LISTCOL VAR=IFCLTYPE USAGE=OUTPUT.Line           Type
:LISTCOL VAR=IFCSTS USAGE=OUTPUT.Interface Status
:LISTCOL VAR=IFCALIAS USAGE=OUTPUT.Alias                         Name
:LISTCOL VAR=IFCTEXT USAGE=OUTPUT.Text
:LISTVIEW COLS='OPT IFCADR IFCMASK IFCLIND IFCLTYPE'.
:LISTVIEW COLS='OPT IFCADR IFCMASK IFCSTS IFCALIAS'.
:LISTVIEW COLS='OPT IFCADR IFCMASK IFCTEXT'.
:ELIST.
:EPANEL.
:PANEL NAME=DSPIFC HELP=HLPDSP KEYL=DSPKEYS ENTER='RETURN 0' TOPSEP=SYSNAM.Display TCP/IP Interface
:DATA DEPTH='*' SCROLL=IND.
:DATACOL WIDTH=48.
:DATACOL WIDTH=78.
:DATAI VAR=DADR USAGE=OUTPUT.Internet address
:DATAI VAR=DMASK USAGE=OUTPUT.Subnet mask
:DATAI VAR=DLIND USAGE=OUTPUT.Line description
:DATAI VAR=DALIAS USAGE=OUTPUT.Alias name
:DATAI VAR=DCCSID USAGE=OUTPUT.Alias name CCSID
:DATAI VAR=DLTYPE USAGE=OUTPUT.Line type
:DATAI VAR=DLCLIFC USAGE=OUTPUT.Associated local interface
:DATAI VAR=DSTS USAGE=OUTPUT.Interface status
:DATAI VAR=DTOS USAGE=OUTPUT.Type of service
:DATAI VAR=DMTU USAGE=OUTPUT.Maximum transmission unit
:DATAI VAR=DAUTO USAGE=OUTPUT.Automatic start
:DATAI VAR=DTEXT USAGE=OUTPUT.Text description
:EDATA.
:BOTINST.Press Enter to continue.
:EPANEL.
:HELP NAME=HLPIFC.Work with TCP/IP Interfaces - Help
:P.The IPv4 interfaces in address order: each address, its mask and the
line it runs on. F11 shows their status and alias names, then their text.
Type an option next to an interface to change, remove, display, start or
end it; option 1 adds one.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=HLPDSP.Display TCP/IP Interface - Help
:P.One interface's configuration and its status now.
:EHELP.
:EPNLGRP.
